2	// NO external libraries (no CUTLASS/CuTe/cuBLAS/cuDNN).  torch appears ONLY in the host mha_fwd +
3	// TORCH_LIBRARY registration (the allowed boundary).  Registers the exact vLLM `_vllm_fa3_C` op
