153	// Reuses the validated hd128 wgmma+softmax consumer mainloop from fused_attn.cu (1 producer + 2
154	// consumer warpgroups, 128x128 tile, 3-stage K/V ring, intra-WG QK||PV overlap), but replaces the
155	// whole-tensor TMA load path with a cp.async GATHER that swizzle-stores packed-Q and paged/contig
156	// K/V into the SAME 128B-swizzle smem layout the descriptors expect (tma_swz_test{,_v}.cu proved
157	// this layout reproduces TMA byte-for-byte). Epilogue scatters O/LSE via the pack-GQA divmod.
